cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Benchmark Suite and Ground-Truth Methodology for Formal
  Verification of IEC 61131-3 Ladder Diagram Programs
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark suite, please cite both the
  accompanying paper and this artifact.
type: dataset
version: 1.1.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21642385
repository-code: https://github.com/pierredantas/esbmc-plc-benchmark-suite
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21642385
    description: Version-independent DOI, always resolving to the latest release
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21642386
    description: DOI of the archived v1.0.1 release
abstract: >-
  A suite of 92 IEC 61131-3 benchmarks over 138 program variants
  (15 textual Ladder Diagram, 74 graphical Ladder Diagram, 34
  Structured Text, 7 Function Block Diagram, 5 Sequential Function
  Chart, 3 Instruction List) across ten industrial domains, each
  paired with a formal safety property, a machine-checkable
  expected verdict, a recorded ground-truth method, and a
  triggering witness for every violation. Packaged in an
  SV-COMP-compatible layout with a JSON Schema, validator, tool
  adapters, a one-command re-check harness, and a companion
  teaching portal of worked lessons built from the recorded runs.
